.Re
.Sh HISTORY
The
.Nm virtio
driver first appeared in
.Nx 6.0 .
Support for attachment via
.Xr acpi 4
and via fdt was added in
.Nx 9.0 .
Support for attachment via
.Xr pv 4
was added in
.Nx 11.0 .
